==================================================
24. ERASE-REMOVE IDIOM
==================================================

Remove all occurrences of x:

v.erase(remove(v.begin(), v.end(), x), v.end());

Example:

vector<int> v = {1, 2, 3, 2, 4, 2};

v.erase(remove(v.begin(), v.end(), 2), v.end());

Result:
1 3 4


==================================================
25. REMOVE DUPLICATES
==================================================

Sort first:

sort(v.begin(), v.end());

v.erase(unique(v.begin(), v.end()), v.end());

Example:

1 2 2 3 3 4

becomes:

1 2 3 4


